WEBVTT

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.930
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.630
<b>Episode 10: The Happy Elements Episode</b>

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.880
Wait!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:00.550
Excuse me! Comin' through!

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.060
Just stealing the quest before 
they got it was smart!

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.280
War's all about initiative, guru!

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:10.270
Only idiots keep doing the 
same thing over and over!

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.440
Jeez! They always get in our way!

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.030
We have to get it back!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.370
There they are! Over there!

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:24.200
Wait, damn it!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:29.870
Huh?

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.270
They're gone.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.840
Where'd they go?

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.960
Haru, Haru...

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.140
Look at this.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.980
Is there something special about this house?

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.810
Wiseman...

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.720
Wiseman?

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:50.660
Wiseman... That's <i>the</i> Wiseman, right?

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:54.320
Mizaru, Iwazaru, Kikazaru, Guru...

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.110
It's got all their names, too.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.450
This has to be Wiseman's house.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:04.320
They live in a nice house.

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:06.560
If they're this rich,

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.470
they don't need to steal our quests, do they?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.480
It's a class society.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:14.880
Perfect, then.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.460
Let's go teach them a lesson 
and get that quest back!

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:24.600
Excuse us!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.970
Isn't that...

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.560
Hello.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.840
H-Hello.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.150
Wait!

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:38.540
You're the girl who's always 
with Wiseman, right?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.420
Um...

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.400
Luluna.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.530
Right! Luluna!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.370
Wiseman's here, right?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.440
Nope, they're not.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.260
I see.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.770
They're not.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.480
Wait, they're not?

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.000
Nope.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.580
Are you alone?

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.420
Yes, I'm alone.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:00.000
Hey, Haru! Wiseman's not here!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.080
I-I'm not sure what to say to that.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.120
Wait, isn't this our chance?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.010
That's the girl who always 
does calls for Wiseman, right?

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:14.090
There must be some secret that lets 
her constantly call five-stars.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:16.440
Okay. Leave it to me.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:22.190
Hey, your calls always summon 
really strong helpers, right?

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.650
How do you do that?

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:26.370
Dunno.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:30.500
"Dunno"? Even you don't know?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.320
I know!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:35.580
Why not try doing a call right now?

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:41.500
We'll watch and discover the 
secret of your calls.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.940
Good idea, right?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.300
Wait.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:48.850
Is it okay to just ask for it like that?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:49.840
That's right.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:52.600
We're Wiseman's enemy.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.320
It doesn't bother me.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.210
It doesn't?

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.600
Nope. This way.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.410
Okay, time to call.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.370
W-Wow!

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.680
I've never seen anything like this!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:34.520
We can recruit whoever she summons, right?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.360
No fair.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.890
Let me see, too.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.770
Haru, get down.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.860
Watch out!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.520
<b>EnGirl!!</b>

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.520
<b>EnStar!</b>

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.520
<b>MercSto</b>

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.760
What's that?

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.240
I don't know.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.630
But look.

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:33.300
Weird. But kinda neat.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.160
<b>EnGirl!!</b>

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.410
<b>EnStar!</b>

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.410
<b>MercSto</b>

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.660
<b>Change Model</b>

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.660
<b>Terms of Service</b>

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.960
<i>Ensemble Girls!</i>

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.300
Wow!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.160
How did you do that?

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.650
I tapped the picture, and it appeared.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:47.880
Something wrong?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.090
Liza...

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:52.290
Off I go!

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:57.240
<i>It's the first day of the new 
year at Kimisaki Academy.</i>

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.390
<i>I'll be a sophomore starting today!</i>

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:04.640
<i>I hope that I can be a cool senpai...</i>

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.520
<i>Or that's just being silly.</i>

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.400
What?

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.360
Good morning! Good morning!

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.660
Morning, Natsumi.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:21.770
Morning, Liza-chan.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:24.280
Did you see the new class assignments?

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.200
They were already put up.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.460
Let's go see them together.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.920
Okay!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.010
You and I...

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.220
Found us!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.470
You and I are both in Class A!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.880
Yay!

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.540
We're in the same class 
for another year, huh?

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:43.060
Yes!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.470
I'm in Class 3-B!

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:47.110
Rejoice!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:50.240
Wait... we're in a different 
class and a grade.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.590
Why would we rejoice?

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:54.750
Good morning, President.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.120
Indeed! Student Council 
President Tsurumi Himari-chan!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.200
This year, I'm going to 
be as friendly as ever!

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.170
And so...

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.670
Let's all get together on the roof for lunch.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.130
We're getting together already, huh?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.770
What's going on?

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:21.270
Liza-chan, is something wrong?

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:26.310
I-It's like something weird is poking me.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.450
What was that?

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.540
That was so embarrassing!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:45.560
Sexually harassed by an invisible 
man during class, huh?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:47.190
I smell a crime!

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:50.680
All kinds of weird stuff's 
been happening this morning.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:53.870
There was what looked
like girls looking at me...

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.910
It still feels like somebody's watching me.

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.860
Being touched by an invisible presence,

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:02.140
or feeling like you're 
always being watched...

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.230
Is it...

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.560
A ghost?

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:10.930
Just kidding.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:13.620
<i>Don't be so scared.</i>

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:19.320
I can touch and talk to Liza.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.840
She's 1.2 times as cute as usual.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.560
Even though she's Liza.

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:25.880
Is her name Liza?

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:26.490
Yes.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:27.420
Liza.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.130
She was with us until a moment ago.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.460
<b>Communicate</b>

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.460
<b>Gacha</b>

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.460
<b>Card</b>

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.460
<b>Quest</b>

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.460
But now she's inside.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.050
Hey, let's try the other ones.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.550
<b>EnGirl!!</b>

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.800
<b>EnStar!</b>

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.180
How about this one?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.300
<i>Ensemble Stars!</i>

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.180
Now there're lots of boys.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.890
Aggressive marketing!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.510
Who's that?

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.950
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:07.510
Huh?

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.420
Looks like you're finally awake.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.630
Here, let me see where you hit yourself.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.790
Um... Gajeru?

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.840
Why is that a question?

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.140
No, um...

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.920
Hey, Gajeru, where are we?

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:38.520
The nurse's office at 
Yumenosaki Academy, of course.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.280
Yumenosaki Academy...

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:43.290
That's right, yeah.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:46.840
What's wrong with me?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.120
Hey, you awake?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.460
Please, don't get hurt during your lessons.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.020
I'm sorry...

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.320
Lessons?

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.400
Well, whatever.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.400
You look fine now.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.890
If you're fine, then get out of my office.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:09.910
It's a waste for a young guy to spend 
his lunchtime in the nurse's office.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:12.350
Right, right. We get it.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.720
Let's go, Haru.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:14.980
Yeah...

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:20.110
Hey, Gajeru, what did he mean by "lessons"?

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:22.760
Hey, did you lose your memories?

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:26.530
You tripped during a dance 
lesson and hit your head.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.620
A dance lesson...

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.210
Watch out!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.150
Jeez, be more careful.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:38.980
What's wrong?

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:42.490
Didn't we used to do something different?

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.220
Something different?

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:50.680
Yeah, me and you, and two girls... I think.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.060
Girls?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.510
What are you talking about?

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:55.200
You know... Um...

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:59.400
One had pigtails and one was really pale...

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.640
What's wrong?

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:03.840
I don't know.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.480
When I try to remember, my head...

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.080
You okay?

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:11.580
The Dream Idol Festival 
is coming up soon, too.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.440
I-I'm fine.

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.200
That's a really important event

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.420
where we decide the school's top idol.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:18.790
Yeah.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:25.510
Let's prove that our unit, Last Period,
 is the best in the school.

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:28.370
Haru!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.640
What's wrong with you?

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:34.000
Last Period...

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.980
Our unit? What about it?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:42.020
I think I'm really... really 
getting to the core of it.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.370
But my head feels like it's about to burst.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.630
Are you really okay?

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.780
Oh.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:51.240
Is that Haru-kun and Gajeru-kun?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.800
S-Sakuma-senpai...

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.410
What's wrong? Seems like you have a headache.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.370
I'm fine.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:12:59.210
It's nothing.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.750
Hey, vampire boy.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.830
There you are.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:07.560
What, it's you guys?

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.230
Hey, Oogami.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:11.770
If Adonis and Hakaze-senpai 
are both here, too,

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.460
does that mean you're going to a lesson?

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:18.100
That's right. If you know that,
 then get out of our way.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.780
Right, right.

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:23.040
Jeez, you're always in 
a bad mood, aren't you?

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.630
I am not.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:27.650
I like to eat mine with eggs.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.140
We're not talking about bacon.

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.230
Are you making fun of me?

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:32.910
Oh, sorry.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.370
We weren't talking about meat?

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.880
Forget about bacon.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.770
Come on, Sakuma-san. Do you want 
to come to lessons with us?

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:45.170
Sheesh... I don't like 
practicing during lunchtime.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.050
Did you forget, Haru-kun?

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:54.480
I am a vampire, the monster of dark nights.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.330
Huh?

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.110
What is this?

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.750
Something showed up.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.230
<b>It's hard being a vampire, huh?</b>

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.230
<b>Not a morning person, then?</b>

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.230
<b>Rei</b>

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.150
I think we're supposed to choose one.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.230
Okay, this one.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.740
What is this? What's going on?

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:10.200
Huh? Why is nobody moving?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.060
Knock it off, guys.

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:14.060
What's going on?

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.340
Hey, Gajeru...

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:18.040
It's hard being a vampire, huh?

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.080
No, I'm used to it now.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.590
Wait a second!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.000
What do you mean, "vampire"?

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:27.040
And what was that thing I just saw?

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.440
You saw that, right?

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:32.300
Those two weird stick-like things!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.960
They just appeared out of 
nowhere and started flashing!

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:37.140
What are you talking about?

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.060
Guys... You don't know 
what I'm talking about?

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.420
You hit your head.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:55.290
I think you should get a full physical exam.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:58.500
Am I the one being weird?

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:02.210
Something just feels wrong.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:05.030
It's like this world...

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.850
This world?

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:09.550
Weren't we in a different place?

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:14.180
It feels like that was really important.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.390
That stuff about girls?

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.040
Sure it's not a dream you 
had when you passed out?

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.730
Maybe...

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:25.140
Hey there! Harucchi, Gacchan!

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:26.820
Why do you look so down?

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.600
Hey, Subaru.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.650
Did something happen?

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:35.860
He's acting really weird today.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:39.340
What, is something bothering you?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:42.330
No, that's not it...

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.140
That is strange.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:45.050
Right?

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:50.630
At times like that, the best thing 
to do is try something different.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.480
You won't get anywhere worrying all day.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.470
I know!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.720
There's a game I'm really into right now.

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:03.040
Why not try it, see if you feel better?

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.970
A game? The one you let me play?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:07.950
That's right.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.260
I'm terrible at that one.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:14.080
Chaining, guarding... It's so hard,
 it just ticks me off.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.180
That's what makes it good, though.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.490
Here, give it a try.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.040
Is something wrong?

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.550
No...

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.940
Hey, you're really sweating.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.080
You okay?

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.440
I remember!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:39.180
I remember... I remember everything!

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:41.390
Haru!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.300
Liza... Choco...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:44.840
I'm a period,

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.540
and I was following Wiseman...

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:48.700
What are you saying?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:49.980
Snap out of it!

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.820
I was right!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.660
Our world was real!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.200
Harucchi!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.710
Just calm down, okay?

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.130
Gacchan's getting scared.

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.580
Who are you?

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:09.840
This is the real world, where we lived.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.620
Who are you?

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:13.490
What is this place?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:14.550
What are you talking about?

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.240
It's just a video game!

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.060
No!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:21.030
Our world isn't a game!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.560
Hey, Haru-kun!

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:30.680
Gajeru, let's go.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.280
Hey, what are you talking about, Haru?

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.610
This isn't our world!

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.520
Haru, let me go!

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:40.780
What's going on?!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.240
This world is fake!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:46.290
We have to get back to our own world.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.510
I said, let me go!

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:52.440
Didn't you remember anything 
when you saw that game, Gajeru?

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:54.700
You don't remember Choco and Liza?

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.760
There you are.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:01.720
You're the beasts who were making 
a mess in the classroom, right?

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.280
Himemiya Touri, with the student council...

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:08.010
We can't have people causing problems.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:10.720
The student council's busy.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:12.780
That's not our problem.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.520
You're a part of this world now.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:20.510
You haven't figured that out?

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:21.320
What do you mean?

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.160
I mean this.

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:24.490
Gajeru?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.530
Is something wrong?

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.080
What's so surprising?

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:32.540
Why? Why is your voice coming out of Gajeru?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.340
Why wouldn't it? I'm Gajeru.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:42.760
I left Gajeru so that you 
wouldn't be confused.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:43.900
What?

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.250
What's going on?

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:48.630
I'm him, and he's me.

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:49.560
You understand, right?

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.770
No... What are you saying?

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:56.770
You're just being allowed to stay, too, Haru.

00:18:56.770 --> 00:19:00.240
Well, I think when the time 
comes, you'll understand.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.740
This is a dream.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.070
You're not Gajeru.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.320
This isn't the world I know!

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:08.020
Haru! Haru!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.130
Haru! Haru!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:10.700
No...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.820
No!

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:15.820
Choco!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.140
You're finally awake.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:38.150
Jeez. You weren't waking up, 
so I thought I should go home.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.110
Gajeru, I...

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.770
Who's Gajeru?

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.770
I don't remember.

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:47.700
Yeah?

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.290
What am I doing here?

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:52.560
You tripped during a lesson.

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:53.370
You don't remember?

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.830
<b>Touri</b>

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.830
<b>You tripped during a lesson.</b>

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.880
This isn't Haru.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:59.060
His name is Haru.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.050
He's cool, huh?

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.660
Yeah, he's not actually this cool.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.140
And the art is all wrong.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.500
Art?

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:10.220
Haru, Liza, and probably Gajeru, 
too, are inside this box.

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:11.350
What do you mean?

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:15.100
This box is connected to the 
other side of the call light.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:17.190
It's probably a different world than ours.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.580
Wow, this is a different world.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.450
This is a different world, too, right?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:32.160
<b>The Adventure of the Healer and the Bell</b>

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.230
I think so.

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:29.320
You're really smart, Choco.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:32.160
You know about calls and other worlds, too.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.600
All kinds of things I don't know about.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:38.310
Why don't you know how 
the calls work, Luluna?

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.480
Why? What do you mean, why?

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:43.420
You're the one who always does them.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:47.300
Did I do that?

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:58.980
Luluna-chan, Choco-chan, there you are.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:00.700
Iona...

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:04.320
You were taking so long, I came to find you.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.740
Everybody's waiting outside, okay?

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:11.370
It was getting good, though.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.870
Everybody's waiting?

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.820
Oh, fine.

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.460
Choco-chan, let's go.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.010
We're back, everyone!

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:38.650
What is this place?

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.610
The Kingdom.

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:43.600
Who's that?

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:46.030
Yuu-kun, Merc-chan, and Toto.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:47.970
Did  you forget?

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.740
Wait, did I also...

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:58.290
<b>Normal</b>

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:58.290
<b>This is Piriko from PR!</b>

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:58.290
<b>Log</b>

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:58.290
<b>Seed Monster</b>

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.800
<b>EnGirl!! | EnStar! | MercSto</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Preview</b>

